Subject: [PATCH 08656/11362] Phase 4d: INFRASTRUCTURE-BLOCKED, zero valid
 cells (REQ-ARC-WMTE-6247)

Attempted the live-path A/B for CARNOT_ARC_BOUNDED_REINDUCTION (never
measured since shipping 2026-08-08). Four launches, three real bugs found
and fixed:

1. REPO path resolved one directory short (parent.parent instead of
   parents[2]), crashing the final artifact write.
2. No detection for a reaper-corrupted cell -- checkpoint-resume would have
   silently accepted an invalid (llm_on_row_valid=False) cell as done.
   Fixed with validity-aware checkpoint filtering + a bounded per-cell
   retry loop.
3. The new retry loop's own health pre-check stacked with _ensure_server()'s
   identical internal check, causing a self-inflicted server storm (4
   servers spawned in 4 minutes). Fixed by calling _ensure_server()
   unconditionally instead of gating it behind a redundant probe.

After all three fixes, ka59/off still failed identically on all 3 retry
attempts -- same action count, same reason, every time. The final attempt's
own instrumentation: 4 internal LLM retries, 0 successful completions, over
~27 minutes -- a reproducible, timeout-shaped failure distinct from the
mid-generation-kill signature found earlier this session. A 4th,
uncharacterized storm then appeared on the next cell. Stopped there rather
than chasing a 4th infrastructure issue on a single lever measurement --
the remaining problem implicates the shared, unsolved llama-server reaper,
out of scope for this task.

CARNOT_ARC_BOUNDED_REINDUCTION stays default OFF -- no evidence either way,
the lever was never exercised under valid conditions. Reported as
INFRASTRUCTURE_BLOCKED, not a negative result about the lever. Row marked
llm_tier_operational=False (the lint's own sanctioned, counter-checked
escape hatch -- honest here since responses=0) to pass
arc-llm-on-liveness-lint's real-traffic check.

New reaper evidence logged in ops/known-issues.md (the zero-response,
timeout-shaped failure pattern is new information for that investigation).

determination_preservation_lint, adversarial_verify, artifact_freshness_lint,
arc-llm-on-liveness-lint all clean.
